{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into <strong>Avante! Atlantis</strong>, where tactical turn-based gameplay meets a captivating board game aesthetic! Embark on an epic quest through the legendary city of Atlantis, battling for power and uncovering ancient secrets.<br> <strong></strong><br><strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/Main.gif?t=1745919328\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-Player Campaign:</strong> Embark on an epic journey through Atlantis, battling foes and uncovering the mysteries behind the city\u2019s long-hidden secrets;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/Story.gif?t=1745919328\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many ways to Play!:</strong> Battle solo  or compete with friends in exciting matches! Play locally or over LAN for an intense and thrilling experience. Up to 4 Players in a match!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/Battle.gif?t=1745919328\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Board Game Experience:</strong> Roll the dice for victory! Embrace the strategic board game vibe as you roll for high numbers to deal devastating damage to your opponents;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/Dice.gif?t=1745919328\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Biomes:</strong> Engage in combat across four<i>\u00a0</i>unique biomes, each requiring its own strategic approach;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/Biomes.gif?t=1745919328\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Commanders</strong>: Choose from 8 charming and unique Commanders, each with a special ability to turn the tide of battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/Commanders.png?t=1745919328\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied Units:</strong> Deploy a wide range of units to claim victory! Utilize Infantry, Ground, Air, and Naval forces to outmaneuver your enemies;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/extras/UnitUnits.gif?t=1745919328\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Map Editor:</strong> Unleash your creativity with the map editor! Design and share your own custom maps, using all the tools the game offers to craft exciting battlefields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you rise to the challenge, defeating your enemies and claiming Atlantis? Will the legendary city yield to your might? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure awaits\u2014<i><strong>Avante</strong></i> to glory!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3172160?t=1745919328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/f932293dd987802fa0357fab082067e66139612f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745919328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/e69fc51b1469b8817a5d49b556683be6bb2450b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745919328","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172160/e69fc51b1469b8817a5d49b556683be6bb2450b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745919328